Depends on #53169 (and #53168). Please review the last two commits.

## Motivation

#53169 moved unquantized BF16/FP16 Qwen3-VL text encoding on CUDA onto srt's `Qwen3LLMModel`. Everything else still ran on the in-tree copy:

- quantized checkpoints;
- FP32;
- other platforms;
- Ideogram;
- Qwen3.5's MLP.

So two implementations were left to keep in sync. This PR removes the in-tree text stack (618 lines), and every Qwen3-VL text path now runs srt's model class.

